WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.557
Unit four. Exercise and Fitness!

2
00:00:04.535 --> 00:00:08.251
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.301 --> 00:00:11.529
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.579 --> 00:00:15.543
Today we learn about Exercise and Fitness. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:20.250
Cardio. Say it with me. Cardio!

6
00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:27.813
Strength training. Say it with me. Strength training!

7
00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:35.267
Flexibility. Say it with me. Flexibility!

8
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:42.333
Endurance. Say it with me. Endurance!

9
00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:49.787
Fitness goal. Say it with me. Fitness goal!

10
00:00:53.271 --> 00:00:56.638
Heart rate. Say it with me. Heart rate!

11
00:01:00.138 --> 00:01:04.038
Warm-up. Say it with me. Warm-up!

12
00:01:07.537 --> 00:01:11.203
Cool-down. Say it with me. Cool-down!

13
00:01:14.729 --> 00:01:25.724
A good fitness routine includes cardio, strength training, and flexibility exercises. Tracking my heart rate helps me reach a fitness goal. I always warm-up before and cool-down after exercise.

14
00:01:25.774 --> 00:01:26.958
I can do that too!

15
00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:33.481
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.531 --> 00:01:34.726
Flexibility!

17
00:01:35.885 --> 00:01:41.104
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.154 --> 00:01:42.345
Warm-up!

19
00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:51.777
Did you know? Regular cardio exercise, like running or swimming, strengthens your heart just like any other muscle!

20
00:01:51.827 --> 00:01:53.800
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:54.480 --> 00:02:02.453
Think and answer. What is one fitness goal you would like to achieve?

22
00:02:02.503 --> 00:02:03.653
Great answer!

23
00:02:04.772 --> 00:02:09.548
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:09.598 --> 00:02:12.260
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

